 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 7680,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The first copied byte in the scene record is $02. The caller starts executing one byte later."
  },
  {
   "address": 7681,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Save the caller stack pointer, synchronize to raster and install the scene raster target at $2C1D. Initialize the rope scene sprites, score pointers and sound request $86."
  },
  {
   "address": 7684,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Set up raster dispatch, remember the stack and copy the digit glyphs to the active character bank. Initialize the score coordinates before entering the rope state reset."
  },
  {
   "address": 7723,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Request sound $86 and set $2F68/$2F6A to $64/$3C. Clear the level flags and expansion bits, then position sprite 0 at low X=$40 and Y=$C0."
  },
  {
   "address": 7936,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Refresh the input, then use active-low joystick bit 2 for the left path and bit 4 for the fire path. While $2EE0 is nonzero skip the initial input test."
  },
  {
   "address": 8169,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Test sprite 0 high X and whether low X has crossed $C0. Before the target is reached count down $2DC1. On timeout send failure code 3 to $27D4."
  },
  {
   "address": 8721,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Compare low X for sprite 0 with $66. The approach counts down $2DC1, while the crossed threshold with a pending action clears sprite 4 and restores the base Dirk pose."
  },
  {
   "address": 8983,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Wait until sprite 0 high X is clear and low X reaches $98. A pending action enters the approach at $233A. A timed-out attempt selects code 8 before the failure handling."
  },
  {
   "address": 9222,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Queue the shared cue, select state $0A, subtract two from $2F67 and clear the current rope movement flags. Reload sprite pointers and prepare the next segment."
  },
  {
   "address": 9535,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Look for sprite 0 low X below $10. If the timer expires first, use state $0B and follow the failure handler. With a pending action clear sprite 4 and continue the transition."
  },
  {
   "address": 10513,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Index four sprite pointers using four times $2E58, write them to $43F8\u2013$43FB and disable sprite 3 when its pointer is zero. Call the high-X sprite update afterward."
  },
  {
   "address": 10835,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The rope scene enters the common joystick reader through $158F, which updates $28 before callers test it."
  },
  {
   "address": 12140,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "This scene record ends with the eleven byte marker copied by the unpacker at $0DDE."
  },
  {
   "address": 16384,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Character codes for the first 256 cells of the Burning Ropes screen, using VIC bank $4000 and $D018=$0F."
  },
  {
   "address": 16640,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Second page of Burning Ropes character cells, covering the middle of the rope rows."
  },
  {
   "address": 16896,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Third page of the Burning Ropes screen cells in the decompressed character matrix."
  },
  {
   "address": 17152,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Final page of cells includes the sprite pointer table written by the routine at $2911."
  },
  {
